{
  "scope": "Controlled PAC execution of self-contained Darwin scalar authenticated calls: fixed f32/f64, exhausted FP registers, mixed integer/FP and Darwin stack variadics, IA/IB, zero/dynamic discriminator and raw controls. Actual Mach-O text is copied without code generation or instruction changes. Does not qualify aggregates/HFAs, authenticated storage, whole images, native Apple execution, signed exception unwinding or exact fault PC/ESR.",
